{"id":67472,"date":"2025-08-29T08:24:37","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T07:24:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67472"},"modified":"2026-09-27T23:51:14","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T22:51:14","slug":"sao-silvestre-de-fatima","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-de-fatima\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre de F\u00e1tima 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de F\u00e1tima 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre de F\u00e1tima 2026<\/strong> (1\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>5 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), na m\u00edtica cidade de <strong>F\u00e1tima<\/strong>, concelho de Our\u00e9m (distrito de Santar\u00e9m). Organizada pelo <strong>FTT \u2013 F\u00e1tima Trail Team<\/strong> com o apoio institucional da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Our\u00e9m, da Junta de Freguesia de F\u00e1tima e cronometragem oficial <strong>Stop&#038;Go<\/strong>, o evento assinala o arranque das festividades natal\u00edcias com uma grande festa do atletismo de estrada.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa do evento \u00e9 composto pela prova rainha de <strong>10 km (partida \u00e0s 19h00)<\/strong> cronometrada eletronicamente para Juniores, Seniores e Veteranos, e pela <strong>Corrida e Caminhada de 5 km (partida \u00e0s 19h10)<\/strong>, aberta \u00e0 participa\u00e7\u00e3o de toda a fam\u00edlia. As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es da 1\u00aa fase decorrem at\u00e9 17 de outubro com valores de 12,00 \u20ac (5 km) e 15,00 \u20ac (10 km), incluindo t-shirt t\u00e9cnica comemorativa, dorsal, seguro, abastecimentos e medalha de finalista.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">5 dez 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">F\u00e1tima, Our\u00e9m, Santar\u00e9m<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 km e 5 km<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">FTT \u2013 F\u00e1tima Trail Team \/ Munic\u00edpio de Our\u00e9m<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">1h45 para os 10 km<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 2026-12-05 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 19:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (17\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 16,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (16\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase (sem t-shirt):<\/strong> 17,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida \/ Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida e Caminhada 5 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 2026-12-05 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 19:10<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 12,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (17\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 13,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (16\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase (sem t-shirt):<\/strong> 14,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e a que horas se realiza a S\u00e3o Silvestre de F\u00e1tima 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 1\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>5 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>. A Corrida de 10 km parte \u00e0s 19h00 e a Corrida\/Caminhada de 5 km tem in\u00edcio \u00e0s 19h10.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se localizam o secretariado, a partida e a chegada?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O centro nevr\u00e1lgico do evento fica situado na cidade de F\u00e1tima (concelho de Our\u00e9m), com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o de partidas e chegadas nas art\u00e9rias centrais devidamente iluminadas com ilumina\u00e7\u00e3o de Natal.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde podem ser levantados os dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento de kits de atleta decorre na <strong>sexta-feira, 4 de dezembro, das 19h00 \u00e0s 22h00<\/strong>, e no <strong>s\u00e1bado, 5 de dezembro, entre as 15h00 e as 18h30<\/strong> no secretariado oficial da prova.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e prazos de cada fase?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na 1\u00aa fase (at\u00e9 17 de outubro), a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o custa 12,00 \u20ac para os 5 km e 15,00 \u20ac para os 10 km. Na 2\u00aa fase (at\u00e9 16 de novembro) passa para 13,00 \u20ac e 16,00 \u20ac, respetivamente. Na 3\u00aa fase (at\u00e9 1 de dezembro) as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o sem t-shirt (14\u20ac e 17\u20ac).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de participante oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O kit inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial de alta qualidade (para inscri\u00e7\u00f5es at\u00e9 16 de novembro), dorsal com chip descart\u00e1vel, seguro de acidentes, abastecimentos de percurso e meta e medalha de finalista para todos os atletas que cortem a meta.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona a cerim\u00f3nia de entrega de pr\u00e9mios?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A cerim\u00f3nia protocolar de p\u00f3dios realiza-se \u00e0s 20h30, premiando os primeiros classificados absolutos masculinos e femininos, bem como os melhores atletas de cada escal\u00e3o et\u00e1rio na prova de 10 km.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre de F\u00e1tima 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-05\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"F\u00e1tima, Santar\u00e9m\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"F\u00e1tima\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e a que horas se realiza a S\u00e3o Silvestre de F\u00e1tima 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 1\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no s\u00e1bado,5 de dezembro de